atory viewing."}]},{"id":"mv-030","slides":[{"text":"hr has asked us to remind you that this channel is voluntary."},{"text":"the channel is called mandatory viewing."},{"text":"hr is reviewing the name."},{"text":"mandatory viewing."}]},{"id":"mv-031","slides":[{"text":"in most of our training films, somebody does it wrong first."},{"text":"he forgets the customer's name. he slouches. he's late."},{"text":"he's the only one in the film who acts like a \"real\" person."},{"text":"we're on his side."},{"text":"mandatory viewing."}]},{"id":"mv-032","slides":[{"text":"today the training is a slideshow you click through"},{"text":"while you answer emails."},{"text":"back then a man looked into the camera"},{"text":"and asked for your full attention."},{"text":"he got it."},{"text":"mandatory viewing."}]},{"id":"mv-033","slides":[{"text":"this is the channel your manager meant"},{"text":"when he said \"let's circle back.\""},{"text":"we circled back."},{"text":"mandatory viewing."}]},{"id":"mv-034","slides":[{"text":"please hold all questions until the end of the tape."},{"text":"there is no end of the tape."},{"text":"hold them anyway. it builds character."},{"text":"mandatory viewing."}]},{"id":"mv-035","slides":[{"text":"some people stay up late with prestige television."},{"text":"some people stay up late learning office etiquette from 1950."},{"text":"we know which ones we'd hire."},{"text":"mandatory viewing."}]},{"id":"mv-036","slides":[{"text":"every company in these films says it's a family."},{"text":"we've watched a lot of them."},{"text":"a family doesn't have to keep saying so."},{"text":"mandatory viewing."}]},{"id":"mv-037","slides":[{"text":"in 1992, pepsi made a training video for crystal pepsi, its clear cola."},{"text":"the cola was off the shelves by 1994."},{"text":"the staff on our tape are still ready to sell it."},{"text":"mandatory viewing."}]},{"id":"mv-038","slides":[{"text":"one of our wendy's training films, from 1990, is two minutes long."},